---
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Sunriver Oregon SEO Consultant | SEO Services in Sunriver, OR</title>
    <meta name="description" content="SEO consulting for Sunriver, Oregon businesses, tourism companies, local services, and hospitality brands that want better search visibility and more qualified traffic." />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="section-label">Sunriver Oregon SEO Services</p>
          <h1>SEO help for Sunriver businesses that rely on local, travel, and seasonal search demand.</h1>
          <p>
            I help Sunriver businesses improve visibility in search, create stronger local and service
            pages, and reach people planning trips, booking services, or looking for nearby businesses.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="service-grid three">
            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Tourism SEO</h2>
              <p>
                Reach visitors searching for places to stay, things to do, local services, dining,
                rentals, events, and trip planning information near Sunriver.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Local Service SEO</h2>
              <p>
                Help your business show up for high-intent searches from locals, second-home owners,
                visitors, and nearby Central Oregon customers.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Content Strategy</h2>
              <p>
                Build pages and content around seasonal demand, service needs, visitor questions, and
                searches tied to Sunriver and the surrounding area.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>SEO consulting for Sunriver, Oregon businesses</h2>
          <p>
            Sunriver search demand is different from a typical local market. Some people are searching
            from town, some are planning a trip months ahead, and others are already in the area looking
            for something nearby right now.
          </p>

          <p>
            That means your SEO needs to be clear, local, and useful. I can help improve your website
            structure, service pages, local visibility, content strategy, and reporting so search becomes
            a stronger part of how customers find you.
          </p>

          <h2>What I can help with</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>SEO strategy for Sunriver businesses</li>
            <li>Tourism and hospitality SEO</li>
            <li>Local SEO for service businesses</li>
            <li>Google Business Profile recommendations</li>
            <li>Keyword research for seasonal and local demand</li>
            <li>Service page and location page planning</li>
            <li>Technical SEO cleanup</li>
            <li>Content ideas based on real customer searches</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Good fit for tourism and local service businesses</h2>
          <p>
            I can help vacation rental companies, property service businesses, restaurants, activity
            providers, contractors, wellness businesses, shops, and professional service companies
            improve how they appear in search.
          </p>

          <h2>SEO that accounts for Central Oregon search behavior</h2>
          <p>
            Sunriver businesses often need to capture searches tied to Sunriver, Bend, La Pine, Mt.
            Bachelor, Deschutes County, and broader Central Oregon travel planning. I can help build a
            strategy that fits how people actually search in this area.
          </p>

          <p>
            <a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact Me About Sunriver SEO</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
